#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064206 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064077 :question/id #uuid "d6501a20-6ebd-5786-870e-3527423b6332" :question/math-academy-id "e-449" :question/problem "Calculate $\\displaystyle{\\int \\dfrac{3}{5x+2}\\textrm{d}x}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, let $u=5x+2.$ Then differentiating with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d u}{\\textrm d x} = 5\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\textrm d x = \\dfrac 1 5 \\textrm d u.\n$$\n\nWe can now rewrite the integral in terms of $u,$ solve it, and write the final answer in terms of $x$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3}{5x+2}\\text{d}x & =3\\int \\frac{1}{5x+2}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{5}\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{5}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|u|+C \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{5}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|5x+2|+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "fc4294d6-3d60-5c9e-a862-863e1d129049" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049443 :topic/difficulty 1.2233896690425385 :topic/encompasses [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186428224 :encompassing/rationale "Initial Codex estimate from captured target-band crossing frequency. Selected account foundations: 1 rises / 2 eligible passed source activities = 0.500000; nearest selected fraction = 1/2. Crossing activity numbers [2]; waits [2]. Separate account estimates: foundations=1/2 (1/2). Selection: most observations, then lower weight, then account name; no averaging. Single-activity estimates included. Intervening target updates: False. Crossing frequency is the chosen practical estimate of encompassing coverage; a multi-band rise counts once. This does not interpret color steps as physical repetition units. Method: encompassing-report.md. Evidence: reference/mathacademy/encompassing-analysis-2026-10-11/frequency-fractions/foundations-frequency-estimates.json, pair 1361->30. All account evidence retained in the prepa